            "text": "<p>To work professionally, you’ll need a recognised qualification. A <a href=\"https://studyactive.co.uk/products/level-4-nutrition\" title=\"https://studyactive.co.uk/products/level-4-nutrition\">Level 4 Nutrition Course</a> provides the knowledge and practical skills required to coach clients safely, understand your scope of practice, and gain industry recognition.</p>",
